{"id":"1eeb5b62e855f793","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dim-ce-zero.md","title":"c.e. 集自身的上下有效维数都为零","display":"thm-dim-ce-zero — c.e. 集自身的上下有效维数都为零","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dim-ce-zero","aliases":["43-thm-dim-ce-zero"],"display":"thm-dim-ce-zero — c.e. 集自身的上下有效维数都为零","depends_on":["[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-effhausdim]]","[[43-df-effpackdim]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_locator":"local enumeration/counting argument, consistent with §17.5","verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dim-ce-zero"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dim-ce-zero</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dim-ce-zero — c.e. 集自身的上下有效维数都为零"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28c411f76cbe3176\" href=\"?note=28c411f76cbe3176\" title=\"43-df-effpackdim\">43-df-effpackdim</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"local enumeration/counting argument, consistent with §17.5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>；其余符号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"28c411f76cbe3176\" href=\"?note=28c411f76cbe3176\" title=\"43-df-effpackdim\">43-df-effpackdim</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\dim_H(\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A))=\\mathrm{Dim}(\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A))=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\dim_H(\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A))=\\mathrm{Dim}(\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A))=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：给出长度 n 和 k=|A∩[0,n)|，运行固定 c.e. 枚举，直到 n 以下恰出现 k 个元素，便得到 A↾n；k=0 时立即输出全零。两整数均≤n，可用O(log n)位自定界描述，因此K(A↾n)=O(log n)。注意是 c.e. 集，不是一般 left-c.e. 实数：Omega 的实数下割c.e.而二进位集并非c.e.。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effhausdim]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effpackdim","status":"resolved","id":"28c411f76cbe3176","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effpackdim]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $\\mathrm{CE}(A)$；$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]；其余符号见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-df-effpackdim]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $\\mathrm{CE}(A)$；$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]；其余符号见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-df-effpackdim]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-8"